WEBVTT

00:05.922 --> 00:09.175
[theme music]

00:35.035 --> 00:38.329
[solemn music]

00:51.259 --> 00:53.845
[Jin] The uniform of the mages
of Jeongjingak.

00:53.928 --> 00:56.514
As the mage of Jeongjingak,
maintain dignity

00:57.474 --> 00:59.726
and exercise diligence
in practicing spells.

01:06.524 --> 01:09.235
The Spirit Plaque
given to the mages of Jeongjingak.

01:09.319 --> 01:10.153
[gasps]

01:10.236 --> 01:11.780
Those who possess this plaque

01:11.863 --> 01:15.325
are permitted to access each
and every part of Songrim and Jeongjingak.

01:21.372 --> 01:23.083
Our Book of Regulations.

01:23.583 --> 01:25.001
Obey the rules within,

01:25.585 --> 01:29.506
and if you violate them,
prepare to receive appropriate punishment.

01:31.466 --> 01:34.135
Jang Uk, rise and bow to the leader.

01:35.845 --> 01:38.640
["Scars Leave Beautiful Trace"
by Car, the Garden playing]

01:57.617 --> 02:01.621
[Sang-ho] Jang Uk, turn around
and bow to your fellow mages.

02:01.704 --> 02:03.456
["Scars Leave Beautiful Trace"
continues playing]

02:23.226 --> 02:27.021
From this moment forward,
first son of the Jang family, Jang Uk,

02:27.730 --> 02:30.316
is a mage of Jeongjingak of Songrim.

02:33.444 --> 02:34.737
[relieved exhale]

02:37.323 --> 02:38.449
[chuckles]

02:40.160 --> 02:42.203
["Scars Leave Beautiful Trace"
continues playing]

03:00.388 --> 03:01.806
- [mage 1] Congratulations.
- [mage 2] Congratulations.

03:01.890 --> 03:02.849
- [mage 3] Good for you.
- [mage 4] Awesome.

03:02.932 --> 03:04.684
[mage 5]
It feels like it's just yesterday…

03:04.767 --> 03:06.769
[Dang-gu] All right. Okay, okay, everyone.

03:06.853 --> 03:08.521
[shushes]
Ah…

03:08.605 --> 03:14.861
So tonight, there will be a welcome party
for our new fellow mage, Jang Uk.

03:14.944 --> 03:16.487
Let us all gather at Chwiseonru.

03:16.571 --> 03:19.282
- [Songrim mages exclaim]
- [maid Kim] Everything in Chwiseonru.

03:19.365 --> 03:22.827
including all of the food and drinks
has been paid for by the Jang family.

03:22.911 --> 03:24.537
So, my dear mages,

03:25.914 --> 03:27.957
enjoy and drink like there's no tomorrow.

03:28.041 --> 03:30.877
[mages cheering applauding]

03:34.881 --> 03:38.843
[mages chanting] Jang Uk.
Chwiseonru. Chwiseonru.

03:38.927 --> 03:43.514
It feels like just yesterday that
Jang Gang brought that little baby here.

03:43.598 --> 03:46.059
But this day has finally come.
[chuckles]

03:47.101 --> 03:49.646
In the end, this day has finally come.

03:50.230 --> 03:51.272
Yes.

03:52.106 --> 03:53.149
Hey.

03:54.150 --> 03:54.984
Take this with you.

03:57.570 --> 03:58.571
What is it?

03:58.655 --> 04:00.281
Uh, raisin tree pill.

04:00.365 --> 04:02.283
You take it before you start drinking.

04:02.367 --> 04:04.619
If they're going to drink
like there's no tomorrow,

04:04.702 --> 04:06.913
then, why shouldn't we show them
what we can do?

04:06.996 --> 04:08.081
[clicks tongue]

04:08.164 --> 04:10.500
I do not get hangover
even without such things.

04:10.583 --> 04:12.710
Uh, you're not as young as you used to be.

04:12.794 --> 04:14.045
[quirky music playing]

04:14.128 --> 04:15.505
I don't need to hear that from you.

04:15.588 --> 04:17.882
See? Look, you have gray hairs.

04:19.384 --> 04:21.052
It just looks like that in the sunlight.

04:21.135 --> 04:22.345
[chuckles]
Is that so?

04:22.428 --> 04:25.640
I mean, do you not see
how silky my hair is?

04:25.723 --> 04:26.891
[both chuckle]

04:26.975 --> 04:28.476
Such beautiful hair.

04:28.559 --> 04:30.270
[both chuckle]

04:30.770 --> 04:31.813
Ah.

04:33.773 --> 04:35.441
I'll just hold on to this.

04:35.525 --> 04:36.859
- Huh.
- Ah. Take it.

04:36.943 --> 04:38.486
[snickers]

04:49.205 --> 04:52.417
[somber music playing]

04:56.170 --> 04:57.255
Madam Do-hwa.

04:58.381 --> 04:59.757
Young Master Jang

05:00.717 --> 05:05.430
is a mage of Jeongjingak,
just like Gwanju Jang Gang then.

05:06.723 --> 05:07.765
[maid Kim shudders]

05:07.849 --> 05:09.434
Are you happy?

05:09.517 --> 05:12.895
[somber music continues playing]

05:14.772 --> 05:16.024
[relieved exhale]

05:29.412 --> 05:30.997
[Mu-deok] You have come so far

05:32.206 --> 05:33.583
since that day.

05:40.715 --> 05:42.216
[Jang Uk] I knew you'd be my master…

05:44.093 --> 05:45.511
as soon as I saw them.

05:46.179 --> 05:47.388
Naksu.

05:47.472 --> 05:48.973
I want you to be my master.

05:49.057 --> 05:50.933
I would never have imagined such nonsense.

05:51.017 --> 05:52.769
[Mu-deok] If you do survive this,

05:52.852 --> 05:54.687
I will agree to be your master, okay?

05:55.813 --> 05:56.898
[Jang Uk] Master.

05:56.981 --> 05:58.274
I finally did it.

05:58.900 --> 06:00.860
["Aching" by Kassy playing]

06:34.310 --> 06:35.394
Mu-deok.

06:35.978 --> 06:38.314
How does it look on me? Is it good or not?

06:38.898 --> 06:42.276
I'm not sure. What would I know
about fancy clothes?

06:43.319 --> 06:46.823
Master… how does your pupil look?

06:48.783 --> 06:52.161
Well, it looks all right when it was
Yul and Dang-gu wearing it, but then…

06:54.831 --> 06:57.041
but then, it looks even better
on my pupil.

06:59.877 --> 07:01.337
[soft music playing]

07:04.132 --> 07:05.258
Keep it short.

07:06.425 --> 07:07.718
I can't breathe.

07:08.719 --> 07:09.762
Master.

07:10.930 --> 07:11.931
Thanks so much.

07:14.225 --> 07:15.476
[chuckles softly]

07:17.061 --> 07:19.981
All right, Mu-deok.
Why don't we go drink now?

07:24.026 --> 07:26.237
Jang Uk, wait a minute.

07:26.863 --> 07:29.782
- Uk, this--
- Young master, you look incredible.

07:29.866 --> 07:31.659
- [Jang Uk and maid Kim laugh]
- Young master.

07:33.536 --> 07:35.037
You should take this before you drink.

07:36.080 --> 07:38.040
It's a raisin tree pill from Master Heo.

07:39.417 --> 07:41.419
- Ah…
- Oh, good idea.

07:41.502 --> 07:42.712
But we should share it.

07:45.715 --> 07:47.550
Right, they're good
for preventing hangovers.

07:47.633 --> 07:48.968
- Ah…
- Ah…

07:50.261 --> 07:51.304
Ah.

07:51.804 --> 07:53.431
[whimsical music playing]

07:55.850 --> 07:56.809
[maid Kim] Mm.

07:56.893 --> 07:58.394
Ah. [clears throat]

07:58.936 --> 08:00.354
- Oh, right? Ah…
- Mm-mmm.

08:00.438 --> 08:01.647
Huh?

08:01.731 --> 08:02.899
Wait, no.

08:02.982 --> 08:04.775
I was really going to give you this.
I swear.

08:04.859 --> 08:05.693
[maid Kim] Mm.

08:05.776 --> 08:08.946
Maidservant Kim, come back.
Please take it. I swear I didn't taste it.

08:09.030 --> 08:10.698
Maidservant Kim, please.

08:15.495 --> 08:17.830
[foreboding music playing]

08:17.914 --> 08:21.834
[queen] The one born under the King's Star
has joined Songrim.

08:22.585 --> 08:24.337
His father, Jang Gang
brought forth the ice stone,

08:24.420 --> 08:26.005
and started using sorcery

08:26.756 --> 08:29.091
and he was born from that sorcery.

08:29.175 --> 08:31.886
He will bring catastrophe upon Songrim.

08:31.969 --> 08:34.263
So why do you think Jang Gang did it?

08:34.764 --> 08:37.350
He could have ruled the world

08:37.433 --> 08:41.979
if he made his son king and obtained
the strength of Hwansu with the ice stone.

08:42.063 --> 08:44.565
Why blocked his son's gate of energy

08:44.649 --> 08:46.901
and seal away the ice stone again?

08:48.069 --> 08:49.904
It's because he is weak.

08:50.488 --> 08:52.740
- [Jang Gang crying]
- [Jin Mu] He could not handle it,

08:52.823 --> 08:55.159
so he blocked Uk's gate of energy
and fled.

08:55.868 --> 08:57.912
[crying]

08:59.497 --> 09:00.998
Perhaps it was him…

09:01.958 --> 09:03.709
who killed Gil-ju.

09:04.252 --> 09:05.586
If he has returned…

09:05.670 --> 09:09.423
If it were Jang Gang, he would not have
exposed himself to the people.

09:11.050 --> 09:13.177
I suspect the man known as Master Lee.

09:13.844 --> 09:17.056
We must increase our power
before Songrim gets more involved.

09:19.976 --> 09:21.352
[Jin Mu] Ten years ago,

09:21.978 --> 09:25.064
we found the ice stone that Jang Gang
had sealed away way over there.

09:36.826 --> 09:37.952
[Jin Mu gasps]

09:39.453 --> 09:40.997
You finally found it.

09:42.039 --> 09:43.332
Bu-yeon.

09:43.416 --> 09:45.126
Hand over the ice stone to me.

09:56.387 --> 09:59.015
[Jin Mu] To find the ice stone
at such a young age…

09:59.599 --> 10:02.476
that child had indeed possessed
extraordinary power.

10:05.479 --> 10:08.983
[queen] Jin Ho-gyeong still doesn't know
that her daughter, Bu-yeon, is dead

10:09.066 --> 10:10.359
and still searches for her, yes?

10:11.027 --> 10:12.612
Which is why I am going to find her.

10:14.572 --> 10:16.907
I will find the daughter
she desperately seeks,

10:16.991 --> 10:20.494
and make Jin Ho-gyeong my own puppet
who does exactly as I demand.

10:20.578 --> 10:22.788
How do you intend to find a child
who is dead?

10:24.081 --> 10:25.958
If the real Bu-yeon is gone,

10:26.459 --> 10:29.754
then I'll make a fake one
she can't help but believe it's real.

10:30.254 --> 10:32.506
[foreboding music playing]

10:48.230 --> 10:49.523
Here. Eat this.

10:55.112 --> 10:58.115
Did you say you hadn't eaten
since leaving Sari Village?

10:59.283 --> 11:00.368
[woman 1 sighs]

11:04.997 --> 11:06.165
[breathes sympathetically]

11:06.916 --> 11:07.958
Here, take it.

11:09.794 --> 11:11.128
Have this, at least.

11:15.091 --> 11:17.093
[ominous music playing]

11:20.304 --> 11:21.555
[woman 1] Eat it slowly.

11:22.181 --> 11:24.934
[woman 2] Why is she going to the capital
by herself when she can't see?

11:25.017 --> 11:26.769
She's looking for a friend.

11:27.436 --> 11:30.731
[woman 1] She says that friend stole
all of her belongings

11:30.815 --> 11:32.817
and ran off to Daeho Fortress.

11:32.900 --> 11:34.902
Oh, poor thing.

11:35.486 --> 11:38.614
Do you know where your friend is?
Can you tell me her name?

11:40.825 --> 11:41.951
It's Mu-deok.

11:42.451 --> 11:46.080
The friend I'm looking for
is named Mu-deok.

11:47.081 --> 11:49.792
- Mu-deok?
- How will she find her?

11:52.294 --> 11:54.588
- [indistinct chattering]
- [woman 3] Wow, this is so fresh.

11:54.672 --> 11:58.426
[chattering continues]

11:58.509 --> 12:00.344
- [vendors shouting]
- [customer] Rice cakes for sale?

12:00.428 --> 12:02.596
[woman 1] Wow, what a lovely day.

12:02.680 --> 12:05.182
Oh? Mom, I want that.

12:05.266 --> 12:07.685
- Please, Mom.
- Goodness, with what money?

12:07.768 --> 12:08.978
I want it.

12:09.061 --> 12:12.148
What's gotten into you? All right.
All right, fine. Fine, hang on.

12:14.233 --> 12:16.152
Huh? My purse.

12:16.235 --> 12:18.612
- My coin purse.
- What's wrong?

12:18.696 --> 12:21.157
Uh, I lost my purse.
My coin purse is gone.

12:21.824 --> 12:24.118
- [woman 1] My gosh, what do I do?
- [woman 2] Oh, my ring.

12:25.119 --> 12:27.204
- My god! My ring is missing as well.
- Oh, no.

12:29.623 --> 12:33.002
[ominous music playing]

12:44.346 --> 12:47.516
[playful music playing]

12:51.020 --> 12:52.188
[exhales deeply]

12:57.568 --> 12:58.903
What?

13:00.404 --> 13:02.740
Ugh, it's barely even anything.
[scoffs]

13:05.910 --> 13:07.745
And the ring looks cheap, too.

13:08.579 --> 13:09.705
[sighs]

13:09.788 --> 13:13.501
I gave them such a good sob story
but in the end, it wasn't even worth it.

13:18.297 --> 13:20.299
[celestial music playing]

13:23.052 --> 13:25.846
[upbeat music playing]

13:25.930 --> 13:28.349
[crowd chattering]

13:32.269 --> 13:34.897
[instrumental music playing]

13:45.199 --> 13:46.242
[mages] Cheers, Jang Uk.

13:48.494 --> 13:51.455
[instrumental music continues playing]

13:59.964 --> 14:02.508
- Uk, they're asking for you over there.
- Oh, yeah, yeah.

14:09.265 --> 14:10.808
[indistinct chatter]

14:18.983 --> 14:20.025
More.

14:23.654 --> 14:25.281
- Please enjoy.
- Yeah.

14:32.162 --> 14:34.164
[Songrim mages cheering]

14:58.731 --> 15:00.733
[brooding music playing]

15:03.485 --> 15:04.486
[Seo Yul] So then you knew

15:05.154 --> 15:06.697
who I was this entire time.

15:08.365 --> 15:10.659
[Mu-deok] Seeing as it's in your
possession instead of your friend's,

15:12.036 --> 15:13.913
I'll take it that your friend
is no longer here.

15:14.830 --> 15:17.499
[brooding music continues playing]

15:31.639 --> 15:32.932
Young Master Seo Yul?

15:36.185 --> 15:37.353
Mu-deok, you're here.

15:38.145 --> 15:40.356
I mean, why are you just sitting here?

15:40.439 --> 15:42.149
Did you not want anything to drink?

15:44.026 --> 15:46.695
No, I did. I drank a lot.

15:48.113 --> 15:49.198
I'm pretty drunk.

15:50.282 --> 15:52.242
You don't look drunk at all though.

15:53.494 --> 15:54.620
I am.

15:55.746 --> 15:56.997
So I've lost my way.

16:00.876 --> 16:03.420
I lose my sense of direction easily
when I'm upset.

16:05.631 --> 16:09.009
Well, you can't really
get too lost around here.

16:12.429 --> 16:15.099
Come on, get up. I will see you off.

16:17.518 --> 16:18.769
Did you get hurt?

16:19.728 --> 16:21.355
- You've done something dangerous.
- [Mu-deok sighs]

16:21.438 --> 16:24.775
You're scolding me again?
Please let it go this time.

16:26.777 --> 16:28.445
I'm not in a position to scold you.

16:29.446 --> 16:31.615
Because I'm the one
who's in the wrong right now.

16:32.950 --> 16:34.159
You're the one in the wrong?

16:35.202 --> 16:36.161
Yes.

16:37.746 --> 16:41.166
I have always walked the right path
and never wandered from it.

16:44.795 --> 16:47.965
But at this moment, I stepped off.

16:51.927 --> 16:53.470
[Seo Yul] And I'm holding your hand.

16:58.308 --> 17:01.145
[sighs]
And I'm not sure where I ought to go.

17:03.105 --> 17:05.232
[breathes deeply]

17:06.608 --> 17:08.318
You'll be following me.

17:27.337 --> 17:28.589
Since you're holding on…

17:30.674 --> 17:31.592
let's go.

17:34.928 --> 17:38.223
The reason you get lost when you're having
too many thoughts is that

17:38.307 --> 17:40.434
you're thinking too many things
all at once.

17:41.477 --> 17:43.479
When that happens, focus on one thing.

17:43.979 --> 17:47.566
For now, focus on me.
Just follow me, okay?

17:47.649 --> 17:50.903
["Just Watching You"
by Jeong Se-woon playing]

17:56.909 --> 18:00.037
All right. I'll focus only on you for now.

18:07.544 --> 18:08.879
Young Master Seo.

18:08.962 --> 18:11.507
Something's bothering me.
May I ask you about it?

18:12.174 --> 18:13.133
What is it?

18:13.884 --> 18:16.970
Earlier, you said
you saw an illusion of me.

18:17.054 --> 18:18.388
What did it say to you?

18:19.890 --> 18:21.225
It said that it loved me.

18:21.809 --> 18:24.144
- What?
- Why so surprised?

18:24.228 --> 18:25.896
You used to say that quite often.

18:26.730 --> 18:27.940
Uh, I mean, that's…

18:32.069 --> 18:34.404
Was that… was that a lie?

18:36.365 --> 18:39.201
Oh, no, it's true but then, um…

18:39.701 --> 18:41.745
Yeah. I do.

18:41.829 --> 18:44.581
["Just Watching You" continues playing]

19:10.607 --> 19:11.650
In return…

19:25.998 --> 19:27.499
Did he believe that?

19:29.501 --> 19:31.170
If he does, it'll be awkward.

19:35.382 --> 19:37.342
[both chuckle]

19:37.426 --> 19:39.052
All right, all right, that's enough.

19:39.136 --> 19:42.347
- All this is thanks to you.
- [Heo Yeom grunts]

19:42.431 --> 19:44.391
Madam Do-hwa would be happy as well.

19:44.892 --> 19:46.226
[in drunken voice]
Now I can

19:46.310 --> 19:50.272
feel a bit less sorry
towards Madam Do-hwa.

19:50.981 --> 19:53.567
You've done absolutely nothing wrong,
Master Heo.

19:53.650 --> 19:56.945
She was doing fine in her hometown,
but I brought her to Sejukwon

19:57.029 --> 20:00.824
and that's where she met
that bastard Jang Gang.

20:00.908 --> 20:03.118
She was such a kind girl.

20:03.202 --> 20:07.331
How could I have done that to her, huh?
How could I have done it?

20:07.414 --> 20:10.918
Jang Gang, that awful scoundrel…

20:11.001 --> 20:13.712
Master Heo, you're drunk right now.

20:13.795 --> 20:15.214
This is all your fault.

20:16.965 --> 20:18.926
What? How?

20:19.009 --> 20:23.347
The reason I brought her here
was just to introduce the two of you.

20:23.430 --> 20:26.433
However, look at you…
[groans]

20:27.059 --> 20:30.145
…with that face and your social status,

20:30.229 --> 20:32.189
how could you fail to secure
a lady's heart?

20:32.272 --> 20:35.275
Damn, damn, damn, damn!
How could you? Damn it all.

20:36.193 --> 20:37.402
[maid Kim] Mm-hmm.

20:37.486 --> 20:38.654
It's true.

20:38.737 --> 20:41.323
Master Heo did set everything up for you,

20:41.406 --> 20:43.200
but you just could not win her over.

20:43.283 --> 20:44.743
[quirky stringer plays]

20:44.826 --> 20:45.869
I, too…

20:47.287 --> 20:48.413
did everything I could.

20:49.790 --> 20:50.999
I wrote her poems.

20:53.210 --> 20:54.336
I sent her gifts.

20:55.629 --> 20:57.631
But you did not tell her your feelings.

20:57.714 --> 21:00.217
[maid Kim] Hmm? "I love you."

21:00.300 --> 21:01.677
"Please be my lady."

21:01.760 --> 21:04.888
You just could not bring yourself
to say those two things,

21:04.972 --> 21:08.016
and so you let someone braver
than you take her. Did you not?

21:08.100 --> 21:10.352
Does one really have to say the words?

21:12.271 --> 21:15.399
You should know just by looking.

21:16.191 --> 21:17.693
That's torture for the one looking.

21:18.318 --> 21:20.988
You think they're close,
but they're still far away.

21:21.071 --> 21:22.614
When you think they're gone,
they come back.

21:22.698 --> 21:24.449
You need to say it with words

21:24.533 --> 21:27.119
so they don't look elsewhere
and look only at you,

21:27.202 --> 21:28.578
and they can wait for you.

21:28.662 --> 21:31.957
If they look elsewhere
merely because I said nothing,

21:33.083 --> 21:34.209
then let them.

21:36.003 --> 21:39.172
If they do, if they go elsewhere then,

21:39.673 --> 21:41.133
it can't be helped.

21:41.216 --> 21:42.843
Uh. It can't…

21:44.845 --> 21:46.305
[maid Kim sighs]

21:50.934 --> 21:52.644
Hmm. You can drink without me.

21:53.603 --> 21:55.772
- [maid Kim sighs]
- Where are you going to?

21:55.856 --> 21:57.899
I am going elsewhere. Elsewhere.

21:58.567 --> 22:00.027
Maidservant Kim. Come back.

22:00.902 --> 22:03.989
Please stay. Let us… drink to--

22:04.072 --> 22:05.532
Let's drink together.

22:06.408 --> 22:09.286
[Jin] Maidservant Kim. Come back.

22:09.369 --> 22:11.288
- [Heo Yeom] Oh, dear.
- [Jin] I'll be waiting.

22:11.371 --> 22:13.874
- He's gonna get rejected again.
- [Jin] Maidservant Kim.

22:13.957 --> 22:15.500
- Maidservant Kim.
- Oh, dear.

22:16.960 --> 22:19.463
[indistinct chatter]

22:26.386 --> 22:29.139
[Master Lee]
So this is where the people drink.

22:29.222 --> 22:31.767
Everyone is waiting inside.
We should go in too.

22:31.850 --> 22:34.061
For the sake of my training,
I don't drink.

22:34.144 --> 22:37.731
I have to return to Danhyanggok soon
seeing that my tea has just run out.

22:37.814 --> 22:40.442
- Just pack some food for me.
- [Sang-ho] As you wish.

22:40.525 --> 22:42.110
[background chatter]

22:45.280 --> 22:46.364
[sighs]

22:46.948 --> 22:50.619
[Master Lee] The smell of women's powders
and the fragrance of drink.

22:52.913 --> 22:54.790
This place has nothing to do with me.

22:54.873 --> 22:57.292
[pensive music playing]

23:00.504 --> 23:02.297
[maid Kim in drunken voice]
I love him.

23:03.965 --> 23:05.592
And I love him not.

23:07.094 --> 23:08.386
Or I love him.

23:09.721 --> 23:12.557
Love, not, love, not…

23:12.641 --> 23:15.560
Ugh. What am I doing?

23:15.644 --> 23:17.187
Ugh, never mind.

23:17.270 --> 23:18.355
[playful music playing]

23:18.438 --> 23:19.606
[grunts]

23:19.689 --> 23:21.149
[gasps]

23:22.275 --> 23:25.445
Oh, no, what do I do? Wh-what…

23:25.529 --> 23:26.780
Ugh. Right.

23:28.615 --> 23:29.783
Oh.

23:30.909 --> 23:32.661
[playful music continues playing]

23:33.245 --> 23:34.371
[grunts]

23:37.165 --> 23:38.125
[grunts]

23:42.921 --> 23:45.590
[screaming]

23:45.674 --> 23:47.467
[maid Kim grunts]

23:49.261 --> 23:50.595
[tranquil music playing]

23:51.429 --> 23:52.806
[maid Kim gasps softly]

23:54.307 --> 23:56.726
[thrilling music playing]

24:03.358 --> 24:04.484
Ah.

24:06.236 --> 24:07.904
[chuckles softly]

24:11.032 --> 24:13.743
[whimsical music playing]

24:13.827 --> 24:14.870
[gasps softly]

24:30.594 --> 24:32.012
So you're a mage.

24:32.095 --> 24:33.930
[maid Kim chuckles softly]

24:37.559 --> 24:38.560
Master Lee?

24:39.936 --> 24:41.479
You are Master Lee, aren't you?

24:41.563 --> 24:42.439
[chuckles]

24:42.522 --> 24:46.151
I'm the Jang family maidservant.
I serve Young Master Jang.

24:46.234 --> 24:47.360
Mm.

24:47.444 --> 24:48.820
Thank you so much.

24:49.404 --> 24:50.530
Oh, no need. Don't worry about it.

24:51.740 --> 24:52.699
[Master Lee] Huh?

24:53.450 --> 24:54.284
[maid Kim] Ah.

24:54.993 --> 24:56.119
It's…

24:56.828 --> 24:57.913
[Master Lee] Oh.

24:57.996 --> 24:59.039
Oh.

24:59.122 --> 25:00.498
- Oh, yes.
- [maid Kim grunts]

25:01.249 --> 25:02.375
[both exclaim]

25:02.459 --> 25:04.419
[romantic music playing]

25:07.422 --> 25:08.840
[chuckles softly]

25:08.924 --> 25:11.051
[maid Kim] It must have gotten tangled
when you caught me.

25:11.134 --> 25:13.887
Give me a moment. Let-- let me do it.

25:14.554 --> 25:16.932
All right. Please allow me.

25:20.018 --> 25:22.270
[whimsical music playing]

25:22.354 --> 25:23.605
[chuckles]

25:23.688 --> 25:25.232
There you go. Mm.

25:27.484 --> 25:28.526
[maid Kim sighs]

25:29.194 --> 25:32.280
I wanted to say thank you anyway

25:32.364 --> 25:34.824
and I've been wondering when you'd come.

25:36.159 --> 25:37.077
Gosh.

25:37.160 --> 25:38.411
There.

25:38.495 --> 25:39.537
[sighs]

25:39.621 --> 25:40.580
Huh?

25:41.414 --> 25:42.415
Where'd he go?

25:43.833 --> 25:44.918
Master Lee?

25:45.502 --> 25:46.586
[Master Lee gasps]

25:50.590 --> 25:53.093
[quirky music playing]

25:56.012 --> 25:57.430
[gasps]

25:57.514 --> 26:00.141
[sultry music playing]

26:00.767 --> 26:03.395
Is it because I haven't had
chaste herb tea in days?

26:03.478 --> 26:05.272
[heart pounds, moans]

26:06.606 --> 26:09.901
SEJUKWON

26:11.528 --> 26:13.905
[doctor] I'm afraid Master Heo Yeom
isn't here at the moment.

26:13.989 --> 26:16.283
But he was very much looking forward
to meeting you, Young Lady Heo.

26:16.950 --> 26:18.076
Please come in.

26:21.288 --> 26:22.289
[Sun-i grunts]

26:24.499 --> 26:27.043
If it's a welcome party
for the new mage of Jeongjingak,

26:27.127 --> 26:28.712
Master Heo may return quite drunk.

26:30.213 --> 26:32.549
It's true. Grandfather does love to drink.

26:33.174 --> 26:37.095
My lady, shall we also
try heading over to Chwiseonru?

26:37.887 --> 26:40.557
I mean, isn't your future husband
going to be there tonight?

26:41.266 --> 26:44.269
- What?
- I heard everything from your mother.

26:44.352 --> 26:48.523
There are mages that your grandfather
has picked out for your future husband.

26:48.606 --> 26:51.568
I hear that the heir to Songrim,
Pank Dang-gu,

26:51.651 --> 26:53.778
and Seo Yul from the Seo family are on it.

26:53.862 --> 26:56.031
I did not come here to get married.

26:56.573 --> 26:58.658
I came here to assist
with the royal infirmary.

26:58.742 --> 27:01.911
Do you think the Crown Prince
might be on the list too?

27:02.704 --> 27:05.457
- With your beauty, my lady--
- Sun-i, please.

27:05.540 --> 27:07.667
Did you already forget
how embarrassed we were…

27:09.419 --> 27:10.837
the last time?

27:10.920 --> 27:13.715
Oh, we should have gotten the name right

27:14.382 --> 27:17.469
of that annoying mage so that we could
tell Master Heo about what he did.

27:19.721 --> 27:20.805
I know.

27:21.765 --> 27:23.767
We should have asked for his name
at least.

27:23.850 --> 27:25.852
[soft music playing]

27:26.478 --> 27:27.479
Are you all right?

27:31.149 --> 27:32.692
I wonder if I will get…

27:35.779 --> 27:37.155
to see him again.

27:39.074 --> 27:40.867
- [liquid pouring]
- [Heo Yeom] Mm.

27:41.701 --> 27:43.036
Uh, that's good.

27:45.580 --> 27:46.498
[Heo Yeom groans softly]

27:47.457 --> 27:51.628
Uk, since you seem to have a favor
to repay me,

27:51.711 --> 27:53.463
promise me something.

27:53.546 --> 27:55.924
- What's that?
- One day,

27:56.007 --> 28:00.595
no matter what I ask of you,
you must do exactly as I say.

28:01.721 --> 28:02.972
Yes. All right. I promise that.

28:03.723 --> 28:05.475
Ah. Wait.

28:05.558 --> 28:08.812
Before you promise, there is something
that I want to ask you.

28:08.895 --> 28:13.441
I am only asking since you have
a connection to Master Lee.

28:13.525 --> 28:17.445
Have you perhaps started
the chaste training?

28:18.530 --> 28:21.741
No way. Never.
I have never done any chaste training.

28:22.367 --> 28:24.160
No. You haven't, have you?

28:24.244 --> 28:26.746
Of course not. I need to get married
one day, so why would I?

28:26.830 --> 28:29.707
- That is such nonsense.
- That is very good news. Hah!

28:29.791 --> 28:31.835
[Heo Yeom snickers]

28:33.086 --> 28:35.088
You can go on the list. Huh?

28:35.171 --> 28:37.674
You, you, you. You're all on the list.

28:37.757 --> 28:39.259
[cackles]

28:39.342 --> 28:42.095
Make sure to thank Master Lee.

28:42.178 --> 28:45.682
Because if he hadn't stepped in then,
things would have been much worse.

28:45.765 --> 28:47.016
Yes.

28:47.100 --> 28:50.562
You mastered Naksu's Tansu of all things

28:50.645 --> 28:52.188
and you almost got into trouble.

28:52.272 --> 28:56.151
Well, Uk even considered seeking on Naksu
to be his master once.

28:56.234 --> 28:58.236
[ominous music playing]

28:58.987 --> 29:01.197
What do you mean by that?

29:02.323 --> 29:03.158
What?

29:04.284 --> 29:07.370
Oh. Uh, back when he couldn't find

29:07.454 --> 29:09.581
a master
who was willing to open his energy,

29:10.123 --> 29:11.791
he just said it as a joke.

29:12.584 --> 29:14.335
Jang Uk, did you actually…

29:15.545 --> 29:17.213
say something like that?

29:17.297 --> 29:19.340
Yes, that's right.

29:20.467 --> 29:22.802
Yul, tell him what punishment

29:22.886 --> 29:26.473
awaits a mage who tries to use sorcery.

29:26.556 --> 29:27.932
If someone does it,

29:28.016 --> 29:30.602
their energy flow will be cut off
so they'll never cast spells again.

29:30.685 --> 29:32.437
They'll be exiled from Daeho,

29:33.563 --> 29:35.815
and their descendants will never be mages.

29:35.899 --> 29:37.108
Remember it well.

29:40.028 --> 29:43.573
Do not ever dare to say such things again.

29:44.491 --> 29:46.618
Why is using sorcery always a bad thing?

29:47.368 --> 29:48.369
What?

29:48.453 --> 29:50.455
Regular magic can also be used to kill.

29:50.538 --> 29:52.957
And sorcery can be used
to save a person's life too.

29:53.833 --> 29:55.835
No matter what you decide to choose,

29:55.919 --> 29:58.630
I believe that what matters is
whether their intentions are pure,

29:58.713 --> 29:59.923
not the method that you choose to use.

30:00.006 --> 30:03.176
Does that mean
that you would actually use sorcery

30:04.469 --> 30:06.971
if you thought
it would save someone's life?

30:07.055 --> 30:09.224
If I could save someone's life
with the power of sorcery…

30:10.683 --> 30:13.228
yes, I would do it however I could.

30:14.103 --> 30:15.605
[tense music playing]

30:19.901 --> 30:23.154
You… you! How dare you? Huh?

30:23.238 --> 30:24.948
How dare you say such things?

30:25.031 --> 30:28.159
And as a… new mage of Jeongjingak?

30:28.243 --> 30:30.453
You know what,
if you're going to say such things,

30:30.537 --> 30:32.163
you had better give back

30:32.247 --> 30:34.123
my torrent of energy.
[huffs]

30:35.333 --> 30:37.418
- My Lord.
- What is it?

30:37.502 --> 30:40.547
His Royal Highness, The Crown Prince
is on his way to meet Jang Uk.

30:45.969 --> 30:46.970
[man 1] Your Highness.

30:49.430 --> 30:50.515
Welcome.

30:50.598 --> 30:52.892
[thrilling music playing]

31:02.569 --> 31:05.029
[oriental music playing]

31:06.155 --> 31:09.534
[man 2] His Highness, the Crown Prince.
Show your respects.

31:10.118 --> 31:11.911
[tense music playing]

31:27.343 --> 31:29.596
I came because I heard
there was a party here,

31:29.679 --> 31:31.472
but it seems as though I've ruined it.

31:32.724 --> 31:36.102
In truth, this party
is thanks to me in the first place,

31:37.228 --> 31:39.564
which makes me feel
that I ought to be welcome here.

31:40.189 --> 31:41.774
So why the silence?

31:42.650 --> 31:44.736
I am sure what Your Highness
truly wished for was

31:44.819 --> 31:47.614
my funeral instead of a wonderful party
like this,

31:47.697 --> 31:49.198
so though I can't greet you in tears,

31:49.282 --> 31:52.035
it would be disrespectful
to greet you with a smile, Your Highness.

31:52.118 --> 31:54.120
[tense music continues playing]

31:55.872 --> 31:56.915
[Go Won scoffs]

31:57.457 --> 31:59.167
Be it a party or a funeral,

31:59.250 --> 32:01.461
where many people gather,
there should be drinks.

32:02.253 --> 32:05.214
So I've brought a jar for you.

32:10.553 --> 32:12.597
What if something happens again?

32:12.680 --> 32:14.223
My Lord, you should go down there.

32:14.307 --> 32:17.101
Let's wait to see what happens.

32:23.107 --> 32:25.026
[Go Won]
To congratulate Uk for defeating me,

32:27.320 --> 32:28.655
I will pour him a drink.

32:29.697 --> 32:33.076
- [liquid pouring]
- To Jang Uk, who became a mage

32:33.159 --> 32:36.371
after opening his gate of energy
just six weeks ago.

32:37.872 --> 32:39.165
Congratulations.

32:44.087 --> 32:47.173
I may have lost my duel with you,

32:47.256 --> 32:49.676
however, as the Crown Prince, I'm happy.

32:50.843 --> 32:53.096
To have such a great mage like you
in Daeho

32:53.680 --> 32:55.932
is something worth celebrating.

32:56.516 --> 32:57.809
Accept this drink

32:58.393 --> 33:01.604
and climb to even greater heights
to become the very best mage

33:02.188 --> 33:04.023
and make all of Daeho proud,

33:04.607 --> 33:05.441
Jang Uk.

33:17.829 --> 33:19.330
Thank you very much, Your Highness.

33:27.755 --> 33:29.716
Let me also pour you a drink, sire.

33:36.889 --> 33:38.391
[tense music playing]

33:40.601 --> 33:43.604
May you be a great king too,
Your Royal Highness.

33:48.067 --> 33:50.737
[breathes deeply]

34:04.042 --> 34:05.668
You'll be a great king, Your Highness.

34:07.587 --> 34:09.714
[all applauding]

34:16.304 --> 34:18.181
[dramatic music playing]

34:23.519 --> 34:24.604
Thank goodness.

34:24.687 --> 34:27.190
The Prince doesn't hold grudges.

34:27.273 --> 34:28.858
Not at all.
[laughs]

34:31.944 --> 34:34.155
[Jin] The Crown Prince,
heir to the throne.

34:34.238 --> 34:38.326
And the boy who was born
under the King's Star.

34:45.458 --> 34:48.086
[Ho-gyeong] Two of Jinyowon's
precious treasures have been broken.

34:48.878 --> 34:51.589
They're useless now. They hold no energy.

34:51.672 --> 34:53.966
So burn them.
Go throw the ashes in the lake.

34:54.884 --> 34:55.718
Yes.

34:56.719 --> 34:59.305
Lady Jin, Master Jin has returned home.

34:59.388 --> 35:01.224
[gasps]
My father is here?

35:02.016 --> 35:03.142
Cho-yeon.

35:04.185 --> 35:05.186
- [Cho-yeon chuckles]
- My wife.

35:05.269 --> 35:06.479
Father.

35:07.230 --> 35:08.940
[Cho-yeon] Father.
[chuckles]

35:09.023 --> 35:11.400
[U-tak] Oh, goodness, Cho-yeon.
[laughs]

35:12.360 --> 35:14.195
Look at you. You've grown.

35:15.279 --> 35:17.156
- Even more beautiful.
- [both laugh]

35:17.240 --> 35:19.492
[somber music playing]

35:25.665 --> 35:26.666
I have returned.

35:30.086 --> 35:32.004
I found her on an island in the south.

35:32.672 --> 35:34.423
She lost her parents at a young age

35:34.507 --> 35:37.677
and has no memory of them… at all.

35:37.760 --> 35:41.764
She seems to be
about the same age as Bu-yeon.

35:44.142 --> 35:46.102
Is there anything that you've

35:46.185 --> 35:49.730
always carried with you
ever since you were a child?

35:53.901 --> 35:57.238
[U-tak] Unlike Bu-yeon,
she cannot detect energy,

35:57.321 --> 36:00.533
and doesn't know how to cast any spells.

36:00.616 --> 36:04.829
There's a chance that she lost her powers
while she was away from Jinyowon.

36:06.414 --> 36:09.208
But if she is of my bloodline,

36:10.585 --> 36:12.670
that fact will not have changed though.

36:20.469 --> 36:22.597
If you truly are Bu-yeon
of the Jin family,

36:23.389 --> 36:26.184
this door will prove it to us.

36:31.355 --> 36:33.608
[suspenseful music playing]

36:53.753 --> 36:57.006
I'm not the lost daughter of this family?

36:58.466 --> 37:00.927
[sighs]
No, it seems not.

37:02.470 --> 37:07.266
But to thank you for coming, I'll give you
more than enough to get back.

37:09.185 --> 37:13.731
Do you think Mother will get angry again
out of disappointment?

37:14.815 --> 37:16.400
[Cho-yeon] What should we do, Father?

37:17.818 --> 37:18.778
[sighs]

37:23.950 --> 37:26.702
[somber music playing]

37:58.818 --> 38:01.237
[somber music continues playing]

38:07.243 --> 38:08.828
[birds chirping]

38:08.911 --> 38:10.037
[Bu-yeon] Mother.

38:11.831 --> 38:13.708
The bird in the cage has died.

38:17.545 --> 38:20.256
You are right. Poor thing.

38:20.339 --> 38:23.634
Up until yesterday, I could feel
the faint warm energy.

38:25.052 --> 38:26.637
But now, there's nothing.

38:28.306 --> 38:32.393
Although I'm able to see,
you still noticed this first, Bu-yeon.

38:32.476 --> 38:35.229
All the things in the world
actually have energy,

38:36.105 --> 38:38.357
and I see the world through that energy.

38:38.441 --> 38:42.987
Bu-yeon, you may not be able to see
the things the way other people do.

38:44.196 --> 38:48.117
But you are a very special child
who sees things that they can't.

38:51.287 --> 38:52.747
[soft chuckle]

38:52.830 --> 38:54.999
You made me a new eye mask for me.

38:55.082 --> 38:57.043
Mother, can you put it on me?

39:15.644 --> 39:16.645
[U-tak sighs]

39:17.438 --> 39:18.522
Ho-gyeong.

39:20.733 --> 39:22.401
Don't be so disappointed.

39:22.985 --> 39:25.863
I didn't have high expectations anyway.

39:27.823 --> 39:30.034
So you'll bring just anyone?

39:30.117 --> 39:33.245
So you're just pretending to please me.

39:33.913 --> 39:35.873
And that is why
we still haven't found her.

39:39.085 --> 39:40.169
I'll, uh…

39:41.045 --> 39:43.964
I'll go out and start searching again.

39:45.007 --> 39:45.925
That's enough.

39:46.425 --> 39:49.512
Actually, Jin Mu is going to help us
find Bu-yeon.

39:49.595 --> 39:50.805
Your half-brother?

39:51.806 --> 39:53.641
But I thought
that you could hardly stand him.

39:53.724 --> 39:57.061
Even if that's true,
as long as he finds Bu-yeon,

39:57.144 --> 39:58.437
it's fine.

39:58.521 --> 40:01.023
I'm more than willing to work
with Jin Mu if I must.

40:06.821 --> 40:07.905
- [guards grunt]
- [So-i groans]

40:08.447 --> 40:10.449
I told you I'm looking for someone.

40:11.492 --> 40:12.785
A girl here called Mu-deok.

40:12.868 --> 40:15.121
Things are far too busy tonight.
Come back next time.

40:16.163 --> 40:17.164
[laughs softly]

40:17.248 --> 40:18.541
I get it now.

40:20.459 --> 40:21.961
You don't know who I am.

40:23.003 --> 40:24.171
Who could you be?

40:26.382 --> 40:29.135
I'm a mage from an incredibly
famous family.

40:31.595 --> 40:34.348
Do you want me to prove it with my energy?

40:34.432 --> 40:37.893
[suspenseful music playing]

40:38.936 --> 40:40.020
Ow!

40:40.604 --> 40:41.772
You're lucky.

40:42.523 --> 40:45.151
Had there been energy in my hand,
you'd already be dead.

40:45.860 --> 40:48.863
I'm sorry. Forgive me, My Lady.

40:48.946 --> 40:52.241
This is just a brothel selling drinks.
You-- you discriminate?

40:52.324 --> 40:55.911
The mages from Songrim Jeongjingak
are having a celebration inside.

40:56.495 --> 40:57.580
- Songrim?
- [guard 1] Yes.

40:57.663 --> 41:00.916
And the Crown Prince himself is here
as well, so things are quite hectic.

41:01.625 --> 41:04.253
I heard that she got sold
to the biggest brothel here.

41:04.920 --> 41:06.755
But this is no ordinary brothel.

41:06.839 --> 41:09.925
If you tell me which family you're from,
I'll go and announce you.

41:11.093 --> 41:13.888
No need. I'll come back next time.

41:16.348 --> 41:17.641
What's going on?

41:19.435 --> 41:20.394
Who was that?

41:20.978 --> 41:23.355
[guard 2] She said she's a mage
from a famous family.

41:23.439 --> 41:24.982
I think it's Jinyowon.

41:25.065 --> 41:28.402
I just glimpsed it, but the sash
around her neck had Jinyowon's crest.

41:28.486 --> 41:29.695
Jinyowon?

41:30.196 --> 41:33.407
Well, that makes sense
since Jinyowon's mages have a reputation

41:33.491 --> 41:35.868
for being very rude
and difficult to deal with.

41:36.702 --> 41:37.828
Are you all right?

41:37.912 --> 41:39.997
Yes. It doesn't hurt very much.

41:40.080 --> 41:42.249
It's strange.
She wasn't very strong for a mage.

41:42.333 --> 41:45.002
- Maybe she was lying?
- That crest could be fake too.

41:46.003 --> 41:47.630
You could be sentenced to death

41:47.713 --> 41:51.383
if you're caught pretending to be
of a mage family inside Daeho Fortress.

41:53.010 --> 41:54.470
Very suspicious.

41:56.222 --> 41:58.516
[men laughing, chattering]

42:03.354 --> 42:07.107
[So-i] I guess mages really do have
the most power in Daeho Fortress.

42:08.859 --> 42:10.528
Mu-deok has to be in there somewhere.

42:20.579 --> 42:22.915
I think I need to live off of her
for a while.

42:24.583 --> 42:26.544
If I tell her I came to return this,

42:27.545 --> 42:30.756
she'll let me stay.
After all, she's so kind.

42:30.839 --> 42:31.840
[clicks tongue]

42:32.424 --> 42:34.385
- [man] Who goes there?
- Oh, that startled me.

42:34.468 --> 42:37.054
[all laughing, chattering]

42:41.600 --> 42:42.685
Wait for me outside.

42:43.269 --> 42:44.436
[guard] Yes, Your Highness.

42:51.944 --> 42:53.612
She should be running after me by now.

42:54.989 --> 42:58.117
One, two, three.

42:59.410 --> 43:00.619
[sucks teeth]

43:00.703 --> 43:02.580
Four, five…

43:03.497 --> 43:04.665
[Mu-deok] Your Highness.

43:06.458 --> 43:07.543
Your Highness.

43:11.880 --> 43:17.177
I, Filthy Mu-deok, was once again touched
by your immeasurable generosity and spirit

43:17.761 --> 43:19.263
as vast as the ocean.

43:21.223 --> 43:24.476
Yes. I forced myself
to overlook this matter.

43:24.560 --> 43:26.687
If I had it my way,
I would tear the place apart

43:26.770 --> 43:29.940
but as I said before, I don't wish to be
at odds with the Songrim mages.

43:31.233 --> 43:33.611
What? You think it's petty?

43:34.528 --> 43:37.323
Choosing to hide the feelings
that might have been petty

43:37.906 --> 43:41.076
was actually a very wise
and highly intelligent decision.

43:41.952 --> 43:44.747
I'll only show my pettiness to you,
Filthy Mu-deok.

43:44.830 --> 43:49.168
Knowing how unbearable it must have been
to pour him a congratulatory drink

43:49.251 --> 43:51.587
when what you really wanted to do
is poison him.

43:51.670 --> 43:54.548
I just had to come see you
as fast as I could.

43:55.299 --> 43:57.509
I hate your master so much,
it's gut-wrenching.

43:57.593 --> 43:58.719
Oh, of course you do.

43:58.802 --> 44:00.638
I hate him so much,
it makes me sick to my stomach.

44:00.721 --> 44:02.473
Yes, I'm sure it does.

44:02.556 --> 44:04.016
I also really hate seeing you…

44:05.893 --> 44:07.394
rooting for him.

44:07.478 --> 44:09.772
[somber music playing]

44:13.233 --> 44:15.444
My generosity was for your benefit.

44:18.489 --> 44:19.490
Filthy Mu-deok.

44:20.074 --> 44:23.369
If you ever try to get involved in a fight
between me and your master again,

44:24.703 --> 44:26.330
I'll have to kill you first.

44:27.998 --> 44:30.042
[somber music continues playing]

44:31.043 --> 44:35.005
Even if I die one day
by Your Royal Highness' sword,

44:36.840 --> 44:38.634
I still will never resent you.

44:39.802 --> 44:42.096
So you'll stick by your master
even if it kills you?

44:42.179 --> 44:43.597
What a loyal servant.

44:43.681 --> 44:45.766
Shall I build a statue of you
by that outhouse?

44:45.849 --> 44:49.436
Oh. Well, Your Highness,
I'm honored to receive your recognition.

44:49.520 --> 44:51.021
Never mind. Go back.

44:51.105 --> 44:53.482
Before my ocean of generosity dries up.

44:54.483 --> 44:56.693
- Your Highness.
- What? What? What do you want?

44:56.777 --> 44:59.113
[stutters] Do you have a death wish
or something?

45:00.406 --> 45:03.033
Is your… your injury healing well?

45:04.785 --> 45:06.036
[sighs]

45:06.120 --> 45:08.747
Well, you took your time asking.

45:08.831 --> 45:11.208
Don't worry about it.
It wasn't such a great attack.

45:11.291 --> 45:13.127
And Heo Yeom already took care of it.

45:14.128 --> 45:15.587
You were just caught off guard

45:15.671 --> 45:17.798
because you expected nothing
from my young master,

45:17.881 --> 45:21.343
but Your Royal Highness
is clearly much stronger.

45:21.427 --> 45:24.805
Of course, I am.
But who knew Jang Uk was gonna use Tansu?

45:24.888 --> 45:26.014
What a cheater.

45:26.890 --> 45:28.100
[Jang Uk] All right.

45:28.183 --> 45:29.017
[fly buzzes]

45:29.101 --> 45:32.104
That sachet that she hung by the toilet
to get rid of the flies?

45:34.898 --> 45:37.234
Where is the sachet I gave you?

45:37.317 --> 45:38.193
Why?

45:39.445 --> 45:42.072
I was just wondering if you hung it
by the toilet for the flies.

45:45.325 --> 45:46.452
I have it right here.

45:47.202 --> 45:50.539
Why would I put something so precious
by the outhouse?

45:50.622 --> 45:53.333
Right? I knew you wouldn't dare
to do that.

45:54.293 --> 45:55.210
Very well.

45:57.671 --> 45:59.798
Safe travels, Your Highness.

45:59.882 --> 46:02.176
[quirky music playing]

46:07.931 --> 46:08.932
[sighs]

46:12.102 --> 46:14.438
- [mage 1] What are you doing?
- [mage 2] Oh, for goodness' sake.

46:14.521 --> 46:16.523
- [Mu-deok] Young master.
- [mage 2] Leave me alone.

46:16.607 --> 46:18.650
[Mu-deok]
Will you please wake up, young master?

46:20.027 --> 46:21.320
- Hey.
- [Dang-gu] Look at him.

46:22.362 --> 46:24.531
He's gonna be out of it until tomorrow.

46:24.615 --> 46:25.824
He's a lightweight,

46:25.908 --> 46:29.203
but he drank every glass
the Crown Prince offered.

46:29.286 --> 46:32.122
I mean, why didn't you help him out,
Dang-gu? How come you're okay?

46:32.206 --> 46:33.749
[Dang-gu] I mean, well, I…

46:33.832 --> 46:35.083
I was busy singing, so…

46:36.543 --> 46:38.086
[Sang-ho] Put down the palanquin.

46:42.049 --> 46:44.051
Only those who are authorized
can enter Songrim.

46:44.635 --> 46:46.929
If you are not of Songrim,
you must go back.

46:54.520 --> 46:55.896
You cannot enter here.

46:57.397 --> 46:58.607
I am Mu-deok.

46:59.399 --> 47:01.360
I'm the servant of Young Master Jang.

47:01.443 --> 47:02.528
You know that.

47:04.112 --> 47:05.906
Until now, you were allowed
to enter Songrim

47:05.989 --> 47:07.741
as a servant of Jang Uk who was a guest.

47:07.824 --> 47:08.825
But not anymore.

47:08.909 --> 47:11.411
Jang Uk is of Songrim now but you are not.

47:12.246 --> 47:13.372
So you must go back.

47:13.455 --> 47:15.457
But what's going to happen
to Young Master Jang?

47:15.541 --> 47:18.919
He's completely drunk.
I need to take care of him.

47:19.002 --> 47:22.214
Servants of Jeongjingak
will take care of your master from now on.

47:25.175 --> 47:26.385
[Mu-deok] No. Wait.

47:27.886 --> 47:30.722
But I need to be there
to take care of him.

47:30.806 --> 47:32.057
Please let me in.

47:32.140 --> 47:34.810
You should really just let her in.

47:34.893 --> 47:37.479
Uk will throw a fit if she's not there
when he wakes up.

47:37.563 --> 47:41.567
Not a single Jeongjingak mage has ever
been permitted to bring a servant.

47:43.110 --> 47:46.321
Now that Jang Uk is a Songrim,
he must abide by our rules.

47:47.155 --> 47:49.241
Then I really can't enter the gate?

47:49.324 --> 47:50.784
That has always been the rule.

47:51.410 --> 47:53.620
For now, you should go home.

47:53.704 --> 47:55.581
I will bring Uk once he wakes up.

47:55.664 --> 47:57.082
Jang Uk cannot leave.

47:57.749 --> 48:01.253
Until he's done with his basic training,
he's not allowed to leave Songrim.

48:01.336 --> 48:03.672
- [Sang-ho] Another of our rules.
- [gasps]

48:05.257 --> 48:07.593
That's true. It was like that for us.

48:08.385 --> 48:09.344
[Mu-deok] You mean

48:09.428 --> 48:12.389
I cannot enter and he can't come outside?

48:12.472 --> 48:14.349
So we can't be together at all?

48:14.433 --> 48:17.477
Now you understand.
You should start heading back with them.

48:18.937 --> 48:20.147
No, wait…

48:20.230 --> 48:23.442
[enigmatic music playing]

48:30.657 --> 48:31.742
[Mu-deok grunts]

48:36.663 --> 48:38.624
It's Jang Uk's first day at Jeongjingak.

48:38.707 --> 48:41.209
You want him to break the rules
on his first day?

48:41.835 --> 48:43.045
[Mu-deok grunts]

48:44.129 --> 48:46.089
[panting]

48:48.800 --> 48:51.762
[Mu-deok] Young masters. Please let me in.

48:53.180 --> 48:54.181
[sighs]

48:54.264 --> 48:57.059
[Sang-ho] If you two stay here,
she'll not leave.

48:57.142 --> 48:59.853
And if the leader finds out,
then she will be punished.

48:59.936 --> 49:01.021
Let's go inside.

49:02.314 --> 49:06.652
Mu-deok, go home just for now.
We will try to find a way for you.

49:08.445 --> 49:09.571
[Dang-gu] Uh…

49:14.368 --> 49:15.702
Young master.

49:20.499 --> 49:22.042
Please take me with you.

49:23.585 --> 49:24.836
Young master.

49:30.676 --> 49:31.677
[sighs]

49:36.765 --> 49:38.225
Oh, my goodness.

49:38.308 --> 49:40.227
[Heo Yeom cackles]

49:40.310 --> 49:42.521
Grandfather, I hope you've been well.

49:42.604 --> 49:43.605
Yes, of course.

49:43.689 --> 49:48.235
Wow. You've grown up so much
since the last time I saw you, huh?

49:49.277 --> 49:52.155
Master Heo, one of the mages
collapsed at the party.

49:52.239 --> 49:53.615
He was brought here
with irregular breathing.

49:53.699 --> 49:57.327
Uh, goodness, I'm sure he's drunk.
You can treat him yourself.

49:57.953 --> 50:00.872
But it's Jang Uk.
The one you gave your torrent of energy.

50:00.956 --> 50:03.583
Ja-- Jang Uk? Jang Uk?

50:03.667 --> 50:05.460
[Heo Yeom] Uk? Uk?

50:12.384 --> 50:14.720
[grunting, sighs]

50:14.803 --> 50:17.639
[soft music playing]

50:27.482 --> 50:29.276
[Yun-ok] It's the mage from that night.

50:31.027 --> 50:34.322
Oh. Uh, Yun-ok, come here.

50:34.406 --> 50:35.574
All right.

50:38.994 --> 50:40.120
[Heo Yeom sighs]

50:40.996 --> 50:44.708
His gate of energy had been closed
until I opened it for him.

50:45.292 --> 50:48.044
I gave him my torrent of energy.
His name is Jang Uk.

50:48.837 --> 50:50.005
[chuckles]

50:50.088 --> 50:51.047
"Jang Uk"?

50:51.131 --> 50:54.676
Yes. But this boy mastered Ryusu
in just one month.

50:54.760 --> 50:56.344
He's a genius.
[chuckles]

50:56.428 --> 50:57.554
- In only a month?
- Yes.

50:58.889 --> 51:01.475
He is… very impressive.

51:02.601 --> 51:03.894
[grunts]

51:03.977 --> 51:05.270
Oh.

51:05.353 --> 51:07.355
[soft music continues playing]

51:15.238 --> 51:16.281
Uh…

51:16.364 --> 51:21.369
well, I'm quite drunk, so I should go
and get some sleep, huh.

51:21.453 --> 51:22.871
Will you take care of him?

51:22.954 --> 51:24.706
- [Yun-ok] Oh.
- Yes? Okay.

51:24.790 --> 51:26.374
Yeah, Grandfather.

51:27.209 --> 51:28.376
[snickers]

51:34.257 --> 51:35.425
Oh.

51:35.509 --> 51:36.593
[door closes]

51:38.512 --> 51:41.181
[soft music playing]

51:42.974 --> 51:44.726
So it seems we meet again.

51:46.645 --> 51:48.939
Jang Uk, the mage.

51:50.357 --> 51:52.359
[soft music continues playing]

51:57.489 --> 51:59.115
[sighs]

52:05.288 --> 52:07.374
I've come too far to give up right now.

52:10.210 --> 52:11.962
I'll stay until they let me in.

52:13.505 --> 52:15.632
[rain pattering]

52:18.718 --> 52:19.886
Really?

52:28.270 --> 52:29.396
[Jang Uk] Mu-deok.

52:29.479 --> 52:30.647
[grunts]

52:33.191 --> 52:34.484
[grumbles]

52:35.443 --> 52:36.570
Hmm.

52:37.404 --> 52:38.363
Mu-deok.

52:39.781 --> 52:43.827
Ugh, your young master is dying here.
My head is spinning like crazy.

52:44.911 --> 52:46.079
[sighs]

52:48.290 --> 52:50.625
[enigmatic music playing]

53:16.151 --> 53:17.819
[rain pattering]

53:24.492 --> 53:25.577
[Mu-deok] Jang Uk.

53:27.746 --> 53:29.289
If you leave me…

53:31.458 --> 53:33.376
I swear I'm gonna kill you.

53:49.893 --> 53:51.895
[emotional music playing]

53:59.861 --> 54:01.279
Young Master Seo Yul?

54:03.865 --> 54:05.659
I was worried you'd still be here,

54:06.743 --> 54:07.994
and I was right.

54:10.121 --> 54:11.748
I'm not going to leave.

54:14.084 --> 54:16.628
I will not be separated
from my young master.

54:19.506 --> 54:21.716
Waiting here won't solve anything.

54:21.800 --> 54:24.469
If you stay here, Uk will break the rules.

54:24.552 --> 54:27.097
And then all his hard work
will have been for nothing.

54:29.349 --> 54:30.642
I guess you're right.

54:31.851 --> 54:33.561
For now, go home and wait.

54:34.396 --> 54:35.397
I'll take you.

54:46.574 --> 54:48.410
Please tell Young Master Jang,

54:49.953 --> 54:51.955
no matter what happens to me,

54:52.455 --> 54:55.125
I will come to find him in Songrim.

54:55.208 --> 54:57.252
["Just Watching You"
by Jeong Se-woon playing]

54:57.335 --> 54:59.379
So tell him just to hang in there
for a bit.

55:01.798 --> 55:04.551
All right. I'll tell him.

55:05.427 --> 55:07.345
["Just Watching You" continues playing]

55:59.689 --> 56:01.524
Ugh, my head.

56:02.650 --> 56:03.818
[sighs]

56:04.652 --> 56:06.237
That damn prince…

56:08.031 --> 56:09.657
[sighs]
Mu-deok.

56:10.492 --> 56:13.369
- I need water.
- [Sun-i] Who is Mu-deok?

56:14.329 --> 56:15.622
Hmm. Hmm?

56:16.289 --> 56:17.373
Who are you?

56:17.457 --> 56:20.335
You don't remember? We met at the inn.

56:21.336 --> 56:23.880
- Huh…
- [Sun-i] Misunderstanding!

56:23.963 --> 56:26.925
You were staring only at my lady
the entire time you were following us.

56:27.926 --> 56:30.386
Oh, right, So… Sun…

56:31.137 --> 56:32.597
Yeah, Su… Sun-i.

56:33.681 --> 56:34.808
What are you doing here?

56:34.891 --> 56:39.312
Young Lady Heo is the granddaughter
of Master Heo Yeom of Sejukwon, you see.

56:39.395 --> 56:40.563
I see.

56:42.023 --> 56:43.441
Small world, right?

56:43.525 --> 56:44.818
If she tells Master Heo

56:44.901 --> 56:47.737
about how rude you were that day,
you're for sure be on his bad side.

56:48.488 --> 56:50.657
That old man never really liked me anyway.

56:50.740 --> 56:51.866
Go ahead and tell him, okay?

56:53.576 --> 56:54.577
[Jang Uk sighs]

56:54.661 --> 56:56.746
Wait, you're not even going
to thank my lady, at least?

56:56.830 --> 56:58.540
But she took care of you all night long.

56:58.623 --> 56:59.916
Wait, she really did?

57:02.418 --> 57:04.754
- [swords rasp]
- [both grunt]

57:08.716 --> 57:10.218
But she cannot tell him that.

57:12.137 --> 57:15.265
[Jin] So you have met Uk before?

57:16.015 --> 57:16.933
Sir.

57:17.016 --> 57:19.811
Apparently, Yun-ok
happened to be in some trouble

57:19.894 --> 57:21.980
and Uk was there to help her out.

57:22.063 --> 57:23.398
Oh…

57:23.481 --> 57:26.693
Uk is not the type of person
to help someone voluntarily.

57:27.944 --> 57:29.863
What are you saying about
Young Master Jang?

57:31.489 --> 57:34.534
- [Jin] Hmm?
- I hear you came from Wol Fortress.

57:34.617 --> 57:38.329
Both myself and Young Master Jang's mother
are from there, as well.

57:38.413 --> 57:40.373
Ah. Is that so?

57:40.457 --> 57:42.667
Perhaps it's because you're from there

57:42.750 --> 57:44.919
that you remind me very much of her.

57:45.003 --> 57:46.379
[maid Kim chuckles]

57:46.463 --> 57:49.424
It seems you and Young Master Jang
were meant to meet.

57:49.507 --> 57:50.383
[chuckles]

57:50.467 --> 57:51.634
[maid Kim chuckles]

57:51.718 --> 57:54.095
If people from the same hometown
look alike,

57:54.679 --> 57:56.931
then she should also look like you.

57:57.807 --> 57:58.850
Huh?

57:58.933 --> 58:00.894
But you look nothing like each other.

58:00.977 --> 58:02.437
[Jin chuckles]

58:03.021 --> 58:04.481
I don't understand.

58:04.564 --> 58:05.648
[Jin chuckles]

58:05.732 --> 58:07.317
Maidservant Kim, you're wonderful,

58:07.400 --> 58:10.278
but you tend to exaggerate things
and jump to conclusions

58:10.361 --> 58:11.696
without using logic though.

58:12.739 --> 58:15.074
What does that mean?
Are you trying to imply that I'm a liar?

58:16.367 --> 58:17.535
I didn't say that at all.

58:18.119 --> 58:19.662
[Jin] See what you just did.

58:19.746 --> 58:23.124
You got overly upset
and referred to yourself as a liar.

58:23.208 --> 58:24.292
All right. Fine.

58:24.375 --> 58:27.712
I am a liar, is that right?
An easily upset one.

58:27.795 --> 58:29.881
When did I ever call you a liar though?

58:29.964 --> 58:32.217
Oh, come on, we both know
that's what you were just saying.

58:32.300 --> 58:33.551
You're the one who keep saying "lie."

58:33.635 --> 58:34.928
- I never said that.
- Now you stop…

58:35.011 --> 58:38.640
- What kind of relationship do they have?
- [snickers]

58:38.723 --> 58:39.891
You know…

58:40.892 --> 58:43.520
they are not a couple, uh, quite yet

58:43.603 --> 58:45.772
but they also kind of already are one.

58:45.855 --> 58:48.233
Goodness. Who started getting angry first?

58:48.316 --> 58:50.276
They seem to be close,
but aren't together.

58:50.360 --> 58:52.529
- You said lie first and I…
- [Heo Yeom] But that man,

58:52.612 --> 58:54.989
he has no idea what's going on whatsoever.

58:55.073 --> 58:57.325
- Ah.
- Exasperating.

58:57.408 --> 58:58.409
Unbelievable.

58:58.493 --> 59:00.662
We have solid evidence and witnesses
over here as well.

59:00.745 --> 59:02.705
So what? I should be scared?

59:02.789 --> 59:03.915
[Heo Yeom snickers]

59:03.998 --> 59:09.003
Uh, why don't you tell us more details
about how you ended up meeting Uk?

59:09.087 --> 59:11.589
- Uh, well…
- [Jang Uk] Young Lady Heo.

59:12.382 --> 59:13.550
Oh.

59:14.759 --> 59:16.177
I sincerely apologize
for the interruption.

59:17.303 --> 59:18.596
Young Lady Heo, can we talk for a moment?

59:19.847 --> 59:22.433
- Oh, uh, sure.
- Ah.

59:22.517 --> 59:23.977
If you have something to say, say it now.

59:24.894 --> 59:26.938
Uh, it's something between
just the two of us.

59:27.647 --> 59:28.648
- [gasps]
- [Jang Uk] Come with me.

59:28.731 --> 59:32.443
Oh. What do you think it's about?

59:34.654 --> 59:37.824
Young Master Jang.
That's extremely serious.

59:37.907 --> 59:42.620
He did? And judging by how Yun-ok
followed along,

59:42.704 --> 59:44.247
there must be something between them.

59:44.330 --> 59:45.790
- [giggles]
- Such as?

59:45.873 --> 59:47.542
Can't say.
[cackles]

59:47.625 --> 59:48.501
Oh.

59:50.169 --> 59:52.338
[maid Kim and Heo Yeom laugh]

59:53.298 --> 59:55.174
I'll just go and see.

59:55.258 --> 59:56.384
Leave them alone.

59:56.467 --> 59:58.469
[grunts]
Leave them alone, you stupid.

59:59.178 --> 01:00:02.473
I thought you two said
you were curious though?

01:00:02.557 --> 01:00:04.309
How can you have so little sense?

01:00:04.392 --> 01:00:06.227
He is completely hopeless.

01:00:06.311 --> 01:00:08.396
[Heo Yeom] It's like an incurable disease.

01:00:08.479 --> 01:00:09.397
Just sit down.

01:00:09.480 --> 01:00:10.773
[Heo Yeom scoffs]

01:00:13.276 --> 01:00:16.529
Why is it… always me?

01:00:22.577 --> 01:00:24.120
Uh, what do you want to talk about?

01:00:25.413 --> 01:00:28.207
Have you told anyone about
what happened that day, by any chance?

01:00:30.168 --> 01:00:32.754
[Yun-ok] Following me
all the way to the inn puts me

01:00:32.837 --> 01:00:34.422
in an uncomfortable situation.

01:00:34.505 --> 01:00:35.882
Your looks don't impress me.

01:00:36.674 --> 01:00:38.885
I wasn't following you,
so you're wrong there, too.

01:00:40.345 --> 01:00:41.554
I haven't.

01:00:42.263 --> 01:00:44.849
I wouldn't talk about something
so embarrassing.

01:00:45.558 --> 01:00:48.770
I know you don't think that I'm pretty

01:00:48.853 --> 01:00:50.563
and I know you didn't follow me.

01:00:51.147 --> 01:00:54.442
How could I have told them
something I'm embarrassed to think about?

01:00:54.525 --> 01:00:55.360
You…

01:00:56.110 --> 01:00:58.696
you must think that I'm thoughtless.

01:00:59.322 --> 01:01:01.783
Oh, no, that's not
what I was talking about. No.

01:01:02.367 --> 01:01:03.284
The soul shifter.

01:01:03.368 --> 01:01:06.120
I was talking about the soul shifter,
the one that attacked you last night.

01:01:06.704 --> 01:01:09.791
You mean that person
really was a soul shifter?

01:01:09.874 --> 01:01:13.252
[sighs] Yes, but if word gets out,
it will be very bad.

01:01:13.336 --> 01:01:15.838
So I'd appreciate it if you could
just keep it between us.

01:01:17.423 --> 01:01:21.177
Well, you did save my life,
so I will keep your secret for you.

01:01:21.260 --> 01:01:23.096
[sighs]
I appreciate it.

01:01:23.179 --> 01:01:26.891
Now that we share a secret,
I guess we should introduce ourselves.

01:01:26.974 --> 01:01:28.559
Well, my name is Heo Yun-ok.

01:01:29.185 --> 01:01:30.353
My name is Jang Uk.

01:01:30.937 --> 01:01:32.855
Yes, I know. I heard.

01:01:32.939 --> 01:01:34.732
Yes, I heard that as well. The old man…

01:01:34.816 --> 01:01:36.109
I mean…

01:01:36.192 --> 01:01:39.320
Master Heo is always bragging
about his granddaughter.

01:01:39.404 --> 01:01:42.240
My grandfather talked about me?
What could he have said?

01:01:43.783 --> 01:01:46.035
- What?
- It might embarrass you if you hear it.

01:01:46.619 --> 01:01:47.745
Really?

01:01:48.788 --> 01:01:52.458
"My granddaughter is as beautiful
as a fairy from the Moon Palace."

01:01:52.542 --> 01:01:54.085
Don't tell me he's telling people that.

01:01:54.669 --> 01:01:57.213
Yeah, he said we are all going
to be blinded by your beauty.

01:01:58.798 --> 01:01:59.924
I'm sorry it was not though.

01:02:00.883 --> 01:02:02.844
- Ah.
- [nervous chuckle]

01:02:02.927 --> 01:02:04.387
[both chuckle]

01:02:04.470 --> 01:02:05.972
This is very embarrassing.

01:02:06.055 --> 01:02:08.224
Oh, Grandfather.

01:02:08.307 --> 01:02:10.643
Well, that's how the old man--
No, no. Wait, I mean…

01:02:10.727 --> 01:02:13.146
I mean, that's how Master Heo
expresses his affection.

01:02:13.229 --> 01:02:14.814
He also talks about my mother like that.

01:02:15.690 --> 01:02:18.359
I was also told
that I resemble your mother.

01:02:19.444 --> 01:02:23.197
I guess this is what my grandfather thinks
fairies look like.

01:02:29.412 --> 01:02:30.580
What?

01:02:31.873 --> 01:02:33.458
Do I not look like her?

01:02:33.541 --> 01:02:35.668
[tranquil music playing]

01:02:36.252 --> 01:02:37.503
I don't know.

01:02:39.922 --> 01:02:41.424
I never got to meet her.

01:02:50.433 --> 01:02:52.185
How could I meet a fairy
from the moon, right?

01:02:52.268 --> 01:02:53.644
So it's difficult for me to say.

01:02:53.728 --> 01:02:55.021
[Yun-ok chuckles softly]

01:02:55.938 --> 01:02:57.857
So has your stomach settled by now?

01:02:57.940 --> 01:03:01.736
Yeah. I heard that you stayed
right by my side the whole night.

01:03:01.819 --> 01:03:03.029
[soft chuckle]

01:03:03.112 --> 01:03:04.405
Yes.

01:03:04.489 --> 01:03:08.034
I thought you were my servant, Mu-deok.
I apologize for my rudeness.

01:03:08.534 --> 01:03:09.744
[soft chuckle]

01:03:11.287 --> 01:03:14.332
I-I brewed some tea that cures hangovers…

01:03:19.420 --> 01:03:21.214
[tranquil music continues playing]

01:03:21.297 --> 01:03:22.465
[sighs]

01:03:23.049 --> 01:03:24.050
[clicks tongue]

01:03:25.968 --> 01:03:27.637
I hoped you'd have some.

01:03:29.764 --> 01:03:31.349
SEJUKWON

01:03:31.432 --> 01:03:33.559
[Jang Uk] Uh, hello, excuse me. Uh…

01:03:35.228 --> 01:03:36.687
have you seen Mu-deok today?

01:03:36.771 --> 01:03:38.523
I'm certain that
she came with me yesterday

01:03:38.606 --> 01:03:40.733
- but I don't see her.
- I'm sure she went home.

01:03:41.317 --> 01:03:42.318
[soft chuckle]

01:03:42.902 --> 01:03:45.571
Uh… but I'm still here though.

01:03:46.531 --> 01:03:49.075
Are you saying she just abandoned
her drunk master?

01:03:49.158 --> 01:03:52.078
From now on, Young Master Jang,
Songrim servants will help you.

01:03:52.161 --> 01:03:55.248
Mu-deok is not of Songrim,
so she's not able to enter.

01:03:57.750 --> 01:03:58.960
But, wait…

01:04:02.630 --> 01:04:04.090
[Dang-gu] It seemed like…

01:04:04.173 --> 01:04:07.718
Mu-deok thought she would be able
to follow Uk here after he joined Songrim.

01:04:08.928 --> 01:04:11.889
I could imagine she was excited
about getting to see you everyday.

01:04:11.973 --> 01:04:13.182
She must be sad.

01:04:17.979 --> 01:04:19.105
[rain pattering]

01:04:19.188 --> 01:04:20.731
[pensive music playing]

01:04:26.404 --> 01:04:29.615
Right. I wonder if she'll be all right.

01:04:31.284 --> 01:04:32.451
[sighs]

01:04:33.077 --> 01:04:34.495
Uk must have found out.

01:04:35.329 --> 01:04:36.747
He must be on his way to meet uncle.

01:04:36.831 --> 01:04:38.875
Ugh. He'll never approve of it.

01:04:42.753 --> 01:04:44.839
Not a single mage
has ever been given the right

01:04:44.922 --> 01:04:46.757
to bring in their personal servant.

01:04:47.550 --> 01:04:50.011
I cannot make an exception just for you.

01:04:50.094 --> 01:04:51.137
Why?

01:04:51.721 --> 01:04:54.432
You made an exception to keep me
out of here for the past 20 years.

01:04:56.267 --> 01:04:57.977
So why not make another exception?

01:04:59.353 --> 01:05:02.523
Is this because the master
who taught you Tansu…

01:05:04.859 --> 01:05:06.110
lives outside of here?

01:05:06.193 --> 01:05:08.988
[tense music playing]

01:05:09.071 --> 01:05:10.740
I'm asking you directly

01:05:11.407 --> 01:05:14.285
do you need that servant
to communicate with your master?

01:05:15.578 --> 01:05:18.372
Master Lee has already proven
that that isn't true at all.

01:05:19.582 --> 01:05:22.209
He saved you from a crisis
but people are still talking.

01:05:22.710 --> 01:05:24.128
Some even say that

01:05:24.962 --> 01:05:27.715
the person who taught you
was your own father, Jang Gang.

01:05:27.798 --> 01:05:28.966
[scoffs]

01:05:30.051 --> 01:05:32.637
After saying
he wasn't my father for so long,

01:05:33.888 --> 01:05:35.890
now they're saying
that my father taught me?

01:05:37.767 --> 01:05:41.520
When there are special exceptions,
people tend to talk.

01:05:42.438 --> 01:05:45.524
And your quick mastery of Ryusu
and usage of Tansu

01:05:46.484 --> 01:05:48.527
is indeed out of the ordinary.

01:05:48.611 --> 01:05:50.905
[tense music continues playing]

01:05:51.489 --> 01:05:52.698
Are you…

01:05:53.658 --> 01:05:56.077
really intending to attract attention

01:05:57.328 --> 01:05:59.121
by making people talk about you?

01:05:59.205 --> 01:06:01.958
[tense music intensifies]

01:06:02.041 --> 01:06:05.002
[Jang Uk] I can't make him suspicious
and draw attention to Mu-deok.

01:06:05.086 --> 01:06:06.671
He could find out she's a soul shifter.

01:06:08.464 --> 01:06:11.300
If you say it's not permitted,
then I understand.

01:06:13.302 --> 01:06:16.722
So you're saying that
you'll follow the rules without a fight?

01:06:16.806 --> 01:06:17.807
Yes.

01:06:18.474 --> 01:06:20.267
After everything I've gone through,

01:06:20.351 --> 01:06:24.397
I can't risk my place here
for a mere servant like her.

01:06:35.199 --> 01:06:36.283
[sighs]

01:06:38.828 --> 01:06:41.872
I need to buy a Songrim's Spirit Plaque
from the black market.

01:06:42.999 --> 01:06:44.250
Can you help me?

01:06:44.333 --> 01:06:47.420
How can you ask that
after seeing someone get stabbed over it?

01:06:47.503 --> 01:06:51.590
Also, if you get caught sneaking in
or out with it, you could be killed.

01:06:51.674 --> 01:06:55.845
I really have to stay right by his side.
Young Master Jang needs me right now.

01:06:55.928 --> 01:06:58.806
That is not true. At least not anymore.

01:06:59.557 --> 01:07:02.727
He may have needed you when he was
on the run and training himself.

01:07:02.810 --> 01:07:05.396
But now, he successfully entered
Jeongjingak.

01:07:05.479 --> 01:07:07.565
There will be servants there
who can tend to him,

01:07:08.149 --> 01:07:10.109
and the mages of Songrim
will help him train.

01:07:10.192 --> 01:07:12.361
What is there for you to do for him?

01:07:12.445 --> 01:07:14.113
Why would he need you, huh?

01:07:15.948 --> 01:07:17.324
[sighs]

01:07:20.870 --> 01:07:23.998
The leader has put me in charge
of your basic training.

01:07:24.081 --> 01:07:27.376
I will be your teacher from now on,
so I'll drop the titles.

01:07:28.544 --> 01:07:31.005
All right, I look forward
to learning from you.

01:07:32.506 --> 01:07:33.632
[Sang-ho clears throat]

01:07:34.133 --> 01:07:36.135
This is our Book of Regulations.

01:07:36.218 --> 01:07:40.723
And these books are about the virtues
and prohibitions of Jeongjingak mages.

01:07:40.806 --> 01:07:42.016
Until you have memorized them,

01:07:42.099 --> 01:07:44.894
you're forbidden to leave
the training center. Understand?

01:07:46.979 --> 01:07:49.148
Yes, I understand. I'll follow the rules.

01:07:49.774 --> 01:07:51.609
Begin…
[clears throat]

01:07:51.692 --> 01:07:53.235
[clicks tongue]
…with these.

01:08:00.618 --> 01:08:01.660
Young master.

01:08:03.954 --> 01:08:05.039
Maidservant Kim.

01:08:05.664 --> 01:08:07.208
How did you get in here?

01:08:10.169 --> 01:08:11.754
I thought you might get locked up

01:08:11.837 --> 01:08:14.340
in the secret room again
for disobeying the leader.

01:08:15.216 --> 01:08:17.426
But look at you standing here,
ready to study.

01:08:18.469 --> 01:08:20.429
I am just so proud of you.

01:08:20.513 --> 01:08:23.474
As you should be.
You have every right to be.

01:08:24.225 --> 01:08:25.726
Since you raised me so well.

01:08:26.310 --> 01:08:27.895
Hmm. [chuckles]

01:08:28.479 --> 01:08:31.899
But I must say,
this table is much too low.

01:08:31.982 --> 01:08:32.983
Huh?

01:08:34.860 --> 01:08:36.529
And the chairs are hard too.

01:08:37.238 --> 01:08:39.031
As you know, I'm quite taller
than most others.

01:08:39.115 --> 01:08:40.825
So it's uncomfortable.

01:08:40.908 --> 01:08:44.120
But it's too bad that the rules
can't be changed.

01:08:44.703 --> 01:08:45.704
[maid Kim] Hmm.

01:08:47.123 --> 01:08:51.752
What is your relationship
with the Young Lady Heo?

01:08:51.836 --> 01:08:53.712
What did you talk about with her?

01:08:53.796 --> 01:08:56.298
Oh, her. Nothing important.

01:08:59.135 --> 01:09:02.513
Oh. I need to read all these books.
So you should probably go now.

01:09:02.596 --> 01:09:05.850
Or should I stay and grind the ink stick
for you while you study?

01:09:06.433 --> 01:09:09.728
Oh. No, I need to prepare
all the materials myself.

01:09:09.812 --> 01:09:11.021
They say those are the rules, you know.

01:09:11.105 --> 01:09:13.649
- Ah. The rules.
- Mm-hmm.

01:09:13.732 --> 01:09:14.942
All right, then.

01:09:16.068 --> 01:09:19.196
I'll just be on my way now.
I'll see myself out.

01:09:19.280 --> 01:09:21.282
- [chuckles]
- Oh. But, wait.

01:09:23.117 --> 01:09:26.704
Please take good care of Mu-deok.
I bet she's worried about me right now.

01:09:26.787 --> 01:09:29.290
What does she have to worry about
when you're doing so well?

01:09:29.373 --> 01:09:30.374
I bet she's happy.

01:09:32.001 --> 01:09:34.670
To be honest, don't you think
she's been through enough?

01:09:34.753 --> 01:09:38.215
In that mountain valley,
she had to cook three meals a day

01:09:38.299 --> 01:09:41.177
to suit your fussy appetite,
prepare your baths,

01:09:41.260 --> 01:09:44.430
and wash all your clothes.
Do you know how much work that is?

01:09:47.141 --> 01:09:49.101
Mu-deok really did go through a lot.

01:09:49.185 --> 01:09:53.397
I'm going to take her out
to go see flowers and eat tasty food.

01:09:53.981 --> 01:09:55.691
I'll take good care of her.

01:09:55.774 --> 01:09:58.319
Without you around, Mu-deok can relax.

01:09:58.402 --> 01:10:00.863
[serene music playing]

01:10:01.989 --> 01:10:03.199
Is that right?

01:10:11.624 --> 01:10:13.876
[Mu-deok]
Jang Uk has already achieved his goal.

01:10:14.376 --> 01:10:16.879
Perhaps he wants to get rid of
a master like me.

01:10:17.588 --> 01:10:19.548
He abandoned 12 other masters after all.

01:10:20.341 --> 01:10:23.469
I should have poisoned him again
or maybe use blackmail.

01:10:24.053 --> 01:10:25.930
Maybe I trusted Jang Uk too much.

01:10:26.513 --> 01:10:28.557
[Ju-wol] Mu-deok. Mu-deok.

01:10:29.391 --> 01:10:30.392
Mu-deok.

01:10:30.976 --> 01:10:32.353
You found a Spirit Plaque?

01:10:32.436 --> 01:10:35.356
No, but you should consider
taking a test to enter Songrim.

01:10:36.065 --> 01:10:38.025
You want me to become a Songrim mage?

01:10:38.108 --> 01:10:40.694
[scoffs]
Are you mad? That's ridiculous.

01:10:41.445 --> 01:10:44.156
No, it's not that.
Songrim is currently hiring.

01:10:44.240 --> 01:10:47.451
The competition is so fierce
they're even holding a contest.

01:10:47.534 --> 01:10:48.911
Contest you said.

01:10:48.994 --> 01:10:50.746
RECRUITING SERVANTS FOR SONGRIM

01:10:50.829 --> 01:10:53.540
Ugh. They're only hiring servants.

01:10:53.624 --> 01:10:55.960
What do you mean? You are a servant.

01:10:56.043 --> 01:11:00.130
I-I know. But I'm not an ordinary servant.

01:11:00.214 --> 01:11:01.465
I'm not doing this.

01:11:02.091 --> 01:11:04.343
Why are you so angry? Huh?

01:11:04.426 --> 01:11:06.262
Do you know how hard it is to pass?

01:11:09.181 --> 01:11:11.267
Mu-deok, you look exhausted.

01:11:11.350 --> 01:11:12.935
Have some chicken before you go.

01:11:13.435 --> 01:11:14.687
Hah. Goodness.

01:11:18.816 --> 01:11:19.984
Maidservant Kim.

01:11:20.067 --> 01:11:22.528
Are you coming from Songrim?
You saw the young master?

01:11:22.611 --> 01:11:25.489
Yes, I just went there.
He's doing very well.

01:11:26.198 --> 01:11:28.659
What does he want me to do now?

01:11:28.742 --> 01:11:29.994
When is he coming for me?

01:11:30.077 --> 01:11:32.162
He wants you to stay here and be happy.

01:11:32.246 --> 01:11:34.415
Enjoy the flowers
and go eat delicious food.

01:11:35.332 --> 01:11:39.795
He said to enjoy flowers
and eat good food?

01:11:39.878 --> 01:11:40.963
Yeah.

01:11:41.046 --> 01:11:43.299
[soft chuckle]

01:11:44.550 --> 01:11:47.886
And he didn't say when he would come
to see me at all?

01:11:47.970 --> 01:11:50.264
He can't leave because of the rules,
you see.

01:11:50.347 --> 01:11:53.517
[sighs]
He's determined to follow the rules now,

01:11:53.600 --> 01:11:56.186
so I have no worries anymore. None at all.

01:11:56.270 --> 01:11:57.313
[laughs]

01:11:58.939 --> 01:12:01.984
[Mu-deok] So Uk has no intentions
of keeping me by his side.

01:12:04.194 --> 01:12:05.279
Mu-deok.

01:12:06.530 --> 01:12:10.951
Do you know which woman the Young Master
has feelings for by chance?

01:12:12.745 --> 01:12:14.747
I wonder if it could be
the young lady I saw today.

01:12:14.830 --> 01:12:17.916
A young lady? He met someone already?

01:12:18.000 --> 01:12:19.960
You see, he told me

01:12:20.544 --> 01:12:22.755
that his heart belongs to a woman

01:12:22.838 --> 01:12:26.383
who is like a bird's egg
at the top of a tall tree.

01:12:26.467 --> 01:12:29.178
["Raindrops" by Gummy playing]

01:12:35.309 --> 01:12:39.021
[maid Kim] Apparently,
he is the only person she has.

01:12:40.272 --> 01:12:43.150
I could tell how much he cared about her.

01:12:43.233 --> 01:12:45.736
You understand when a man feels that way.

01:12:48.322 --> 01:12:49.698
He's in love.

01:12:50.908 --> 01:12:52.993
["Raindrops" continues playing]

01:12:53.077 --> 01:12:55.371
But I am Uk's bird's egg though.

01:13:01.168 --> 01:13:02.419
[Mu-deok] Bird's eggs.

01:13:02.503 --> 01:13:06.632
Master, let us stay forever loyal
and dutiful to each other.

01:13:13.013 --> 01:13:14.765
[Jang Uk] I came back from the dead,
thanks to you.

01:13:14.848 --> 01:13:16.183
My crazy master.

01:13:16.767 --> 01:13:17.684
[chuckles softly]

01:13:20.104 --> 01:13:23.857
[Mu-deok] As master and pupil,
our relationship can only last until

01:13:23.941 --> 01:13:26.902
you become the best
and help me get my energy back.

01:13:26.985 --> 01:13:28.112
Then the contract's over.

01:13:28.195 --> 01:13:30.948
As soon as my energy returns
and I become Naksu once again,

01:13:31.031 --> 01:13:32.991
we will no longer be master and pupil.

01:13:34.451 --> 01:13:36.286
[Jang Uk] Is there a reason
you're insisting on this?

01:13:37.663 --> 01:13:41.458
[Mu-deok] Because you won't have reason
to protect me,

01:13:42.126 --> 01:13:43.919
nor will I have anything left to…

01:13:47.089 --> 01:13:48.340
show or teach you.

01:13:49.383 --> 01:13:51.343
Stop it. It's me, Jang Uk.

01:13:51.427 --> 01:13:54.054
["Raindrops" continues playing]

01:14:09.153 --> 01:14:10.821
Man, what am I going to do now?

01:14:12.030 --> 01:14:13.157
This is bad.

01:14:19.163 --> 01:14:20.164
I miss Mu-deok.

01:14:22.082 --> 01:14:23.375
I just miss her so much.

01:14:34.094 --> 01:14:36.430
["Raindrops" continues playing]

01:14:58.076 --> 01:15:00.245
I have no intention of training Jang Uk.

01:15:00.329 --> 01:15:04.041
So you didn't accept him into Songrim.
You merely trapped him.

01:15:04.124 --> 01:15:05.626
Somebody help me!

01:15:07.085 --> 01:15:08.712
[So-i] It was definitely her.

01:15:08.795 --> 01:15:11.256
Where could she have gone
just when I needed her, huh?

01:15:11.340 --> 01:15:12.424
Young master!

01:15:13.342 --> 01:15:14.718
[Jang Uk] What is a letter?

01:15:14.801 --> 01:15:17.387
As long as it reveals your heart,
then it's a letter.

01:15:17.471 --> 01:15:18.722
[maid Kim] There's a young lady

01:15:18.805 --> 01:15:20.641
our young master is quite taken with.

01:15:20.724 --> 01:15:22.142
He's in love.

01:15:22.226 --> 01:15:24.019
[Mu-deok]
This is much harder than I thought.

01:15:24.102 --> 01:15:26.021
[candidates] Your Royal Highness.

01:15:26.104 --> 01:15:28.023
She was always at Uk's side.

01:15:28.106 --> 01:15:30.150
[Jang Uk] When you are reading things,
you cannot see.

01:15:30.234 --> 01:15:31.318
You must focus.

01:15:31.401 --> 01:15:32.819
Mu-deok.
